2:T4f9,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","@id":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/european-collaboration-summit-patrick-stewart-voiceover#blogposting","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/european-collaboration-summit-patrick-stewart-voiceover","headline":"Patrick Stewart Voiceover","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/european-collaboration-summit-patrick-stewart-voiceover","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Guy Harris","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceoverguy","image":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-profile.jpg"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"VoiceoverGuy","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-voiceover.png"}},"inLanguage":"en-GB","isAccessibleForFree":true,"description":"Guy Harris used his classic Patrick Stewart voice for this promo for the European Collaboration Summit's 2021  Dusseldorf conference. Find out more!","datePublished":"2021-11-01T00:00:00+00:00","dateModified":"2021-11-01T00:00:00+00:00","keywords":["Patrick Stewart Voice"],"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/img/blog/european-collaboration-summit-patrick-stewart-voiceover.jpg"}}3:T4b8,<h2>Patrick Stewart Voiceover for the 2021 European Collaboration Summit</h2>
<p>This is actually my third voiceover for the European Collaboration Summit. In 2018 I employed a soft version of my Patrick Stewart voice for the European Collaboration Summit's promo for their <a href="/european-collaboration-summit-patrick-stewart-voice" title="European Collaboration Summit Patrick Stewart Voice">conference in Mainz</a>, while in 2020 they went with a completely different style and asked me to use my <a href="/european-collaboration-summit-tickets-voiceover" title="European Collaboration Summit 2020">professional narrator voice</a>. In 2021, the marketing team at the European Collaboration Summit put together a wonderfully inspiring promo video celebrating community and my classic Patrick Stewart voice felt just right for relaying the message. Among my most popular voices, I've used the Patrick Stewart voice for many promotions, such as my work for <a href="/minecraft-backpack-patrick-stewart-style-voiceover" title="Minecraft Patrick Stewart Voice">Minecraft</a> and the <a href="/nfl-cbs-sports-king-henry-voice-patrick-stewart" target="_blank" title="Patrick Stewart Voice CBS & NFL">NFL</a>.7:["slug","european-collaboration-summit-patrick-stewart-voiceover","d"]
