s/images/guy-harris-voiceover.png\"}},\"inLanguage\":\"en-GB\",\"description\":\"Guy Harris used his classic Patrick Stewart voice for this promo for the European Collaboration Summit's 2021  Dusseldorf conference. Find out more!\",\"uploadDate\":\"2021-11-01T00:00:00+00:00\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Patrick Stewart Voiceover"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Guy's Patrick Stewart voice was just right for the European Collaboration Summit's 2021 promo.</p>"}}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$3"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/DLih0NZHPJI","title":"Patrick Stewart Voiceover","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/european-collaboration-summit-patrick-stewart-voiceover.jpg","alt":"european-collaboration-summit-patrick-stewart-voiceover","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>About the European Collaboration Summit 2021</h2>\r\n<p>The <a href=\"https://www.collabsummit.eu\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"European Collaboration Summit\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">European Collaboration Summit</a> is a major European modern workplace event about everything related to office work. 2021's conference was all about championing inclusion. The message was loud and clear: all are welcome at the European Collaboration Summit! In fact, it's the very diversity of the event that makes it such a success. This is my third piece of work for the summit and I'm continually impressed by the content they put out across media platforms to tie in with their events. When I saw the theme of this year's meeting in Dusseldorf, I knew my classic Patrick Stewart voice would work in harmony with the script.</p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Get in touch!</h2>\r\n<p>If you're working on a new <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial</a>, <a href=\"/explainer-video-voice\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video</a>, or something else altogether, and you need a high-quality professional voiceover artist, then please feel free to <a href=\"/contact-guy\" title=\"Contact Guy\">get in touch</a>. I always look forward to collaborating with new businesses and individuals in need of voice work! I'm more than happy to provide you with a free voiceover sample from your script for you to make sure I'm the right fit for your project. I can usually return my recorded voiceover to you on the same day it's requested, making me the perfect choice if you're working to a tight schedule.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L5",null,{"pageTitle":"Patrick Stewart Voiceover","pageUrl":"european-collaboration-summit-patrick-stewart-voiceover"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L4","953",{"href":"/voice-over-word-count-calculator","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"c